From 360b24983b5e5eac4c38340a111a9d3f6a866c0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephen Appleby <sappleby@tuscaloosacityschools.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:09:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Canvas: Storyflow-style visual boards stored as JSON Canvas
 files (M09-J01)

- planning/canvases/<slug>.canvas in JSON Canvas 1.0 (Obsidian-compatible); StoryForge extras under a storyforge key
- notes, to-dos, colour swatches, images (assets/canvas/), web links, groups, columns, labelled arrows
- story cards linked by id to scenes, Codex entries, threads, events and notes; paths refreshed on save
- API: GET/POST /canvases, GET/PUT /canvases/:slug, archive/restore; upload ?for=canvas; policy classes; board module gate
- web: Canvas tab with pan/zoom (wheel zooms), drag, resize, connect, inline editing, undo/redo, autosave with conflict banner
- shortcuts in the registry (canvas scope); tests for format, routes, model and render
